00:08:58.670 --> 00:09:03.360
Now, historically,
at Intel, we've

00:09:03.360 --> 00:09:09.180
worked with SAP for
over a decade on HANA.

00:09:09.180 --> 00:09:12.150
Each generation, we've
added either new features

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:14.130
of the Xeon processor level.

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:16.750
As an example, about
three or four years ago,

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:20.340
we added a feature
