00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:41.160
And so this kind of gives
you a brief summary.

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:44.940
Now I know there's not a
one-to-one mapping with GCP,

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:48.480
but at least it tells you at the
