4.5 terabytes per processor.

00:10:29.823 --> 00:10:31.990
And if you think about that,
that's pretty powerful.

00:10:31.990 --> 00:10:33.420
So what does that say?

00:10:33.420 --> 00:10:35.250
On a four-socket
